  "change": [
    "Explicit versioned ordered original-word amendment support for issuer identities, parent references, effect statements and effective-date evidence",
    "Trusted consecutive word positions derived from the complete verified sealed parse; complete source/parse/page/span checks in application and PostgreSQL",
    "Bounded whole-statement context rejects omitted negation, proposals, conditional wording, unknown boundaries, gaps and incomplete native projections",
    "Effective-date words must occur contiguously within the effect statement; unsupported dates remain explicitly unavailable",
    "Existing common build/finalize/head path preserves immutable history and scoped correction semantics across M1 facts, M2 comparison, M3 context and M4 company selection",
    "Administrator loads and inspects separate original words with verified original-PDF source actions; loading failures/logout cannot retain verified private support"
  ],
